                                text="&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;light-font&quot;>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-32-reg&quot;>The only sponsorship in Ireland between a multinational pharmaceutical company and a ladies or men’s inter-county Gaelic football team.&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
